{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "sf-490-api-tests",
		"name": "SF-490 - Hide Annual_GWP_Estimate_Year_1_c and POS_FSCS_Exposure on Account - API Tests",
		"description": "Postman collection for SF-490 API tests. Tests for hiding Annual_GWP_Estimate_Year_1_c__c and POS_FSCS_Exposure__c fields on Account (visible to Admins/support only).\n\n## Setup Instructions:\n1. Import this collection into Postman\n2. Create a new environment (or use existing Salesforce QA environment)\n3. Set the following environment variables:\n   - `sf_base_url`: https://arx--qa.sandbox.my.salesforce.com\n   - `sf_api_version`: v60.0\n   - `sf_access_token`: Your Salesforce access token (get via OAuth or JWT)\n   - `sf_instance_url`: Your Salesforce instance URL\n   - `lead_id`: Lead ID for update/query operations\n\n## Authentication:\nThis collection uses Bearer Token authentication. Obtain an access token via:\n- OAuth 2.0 flow\n- JWT Bearer Token flow\n- Username/Password flow\n\n## Test Scenarios:\n- Verify Account__c field exists on Lead and Account\n- Create Lead with Account\n- Update Account__c on Lead\n- Query Lead by Account\n- Reject invalid Account__c values",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{sf_access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "{{sf_base_url}}",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "api_version",
			"value": "{{sf_api_version}}",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "lead_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "SF-490-API-001 - Verify Account__c field exists on Lead",
			"event": [
				{
					"listen": "test",
					"script": {
						"exec": [
							"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
							"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
							"});",
							"",
							"pm.test(\"Account__c field exists\", function () {",
							"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
							"    pm.expect(jsonData.fields).to.be.an('array');",
							"    var field = jsonData.fields.find(f => f.name === 'Account__c');",
							"    pm.expect(field).to.not.be.undefined;",
							"});"
						],
						"type": "text/javascript"
					}
				}
			],
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [],
				"url": {
					"raw": "{{base_url}}/services/data/{{api_version}}/sobjects/Lead/describe",
					"host": [
						"{{base_url}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"services",
						"data",
						"{{api_version}}",
						"sobjects",
						"Lead",
						"describe"
					]
				},
				"description": "API - Verify Account__c field exists on Lead\n\n**Test ID:** SF-490-API-001\n**Priority:** p1\n**Tags:** @smoke @field-exists"
			},
			"response": []
		},
